<article class="env-lemma" id="0226">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0226">Lemma <span data-tag="0226">34.6.2</span>.</a> Any smooth covering is a syntomic covering, and a fortiori, any étale or Zariski covering is a syntomic covering. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This is clear from the definitions and the fact that a smooth morphism is syntomic, see Morphisms, Lemma <a href="/tag/01VD" data-tag="01VD">29.35.7</a> and Lemma <a href="/tag/0220" data-tag="0220">34.5.2</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>